[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR]
Reign of Terror

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_desc]
§g“Not being examples to the flock, but lording it over those entrusted to you.”§!\nThey say it is better to love by fear than by rule. But what if the ruler is the fear itself?

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR]
恐惧的统治

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_desc]
§g“不要只成为羊群的领头者，而要学会向那些将一切托付与你的子民的发号施令。”§!\n他们总说，以慈爱统治胜过以恐惧统治。但如果统治者本身就是恐惧的化身呢？

